    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market 23 Mask Drive, a well proportioned three bedroom mid-terrace property offering turn-key condition throughout. \n\nOn entering the property, you are greeted by a welcoming entrance hallway which leads through to a spacious reception room. Continuing through, a secondary living room offers versatile accommodation that the new owner could adapt to suit their needs. The kitchen and bathroom are located within the extension to the rear of the home. Upstairs, the property offers three spacious bedrooms.\n\nExternally, the front garden benefits from off-street car parking, while the rear garden is exceptionally private and low maintenance, offering an ideal outdoor space for relaxing and entertaining without extensive upkeep.\n\nSituated in Artane, Dublin 5, the property enjoys the convenience of a well-established residential location, with a host of local amenities and services available nearby. The area is well served by public transport and provides easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding suburbs.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended."
      },
